usage: evaluate_entry.py [-h] --before BEFORE --after AFTER --cli CLI
                         --output OUTPUT [--permission-mode PERMISSION_MODE]

Explicit, bounded developer comparison. Never called by the installed skill.
Four predeclared calls, no retries, no installation or permission changes.
Uses a user-supplied existing CLI. Filtered logs omit model thinking and
secrets.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --before BEFORE
  --after AFTER
  --cli CLI
  --output OUTPUT
  --permission-mode PERMISSION_MODE
                        forward only an explicitly authorized mode; omitted
                        preserves the host default
